# Ralph progress: stamps-monetization

## Codebase Patterns

- Netlify Database migrations live in
  `netlify/database/migrations/<number>_<name>/migration.sql`.
- Reversible migrations can include a sibling `down.sql` rollback file.
- Schema tests use Vitest and read migration SQL as text from
  `netlify/database/migrations`.
- `tsconfig.json` includes `vitest/globals` because many existing tests use
  global Vitest APIs such as `expect`.
- Stamp accounting services use `getDatabase().pool.connect()` and explicit
  `BEGIN`/`COMMIT` transactions when multiple writes must stay consistent.

