Thread: https://ampcode.com/threads/unknown
- Implemented `creditStampLot` as the credit chokepoint for purchases,
  grants, and received gifts.
- The service inserts a stamp lot, increments `users.stamps_balance`, and
  writes the positive transaction row inside one explicit DB transaction.
